@spec wp_smoke_spec  src=tests/specs/wp_smoke_spec.lua  loc=132  cases=5
@exercises commandManager (h.cmgr)
@surface   cmgr:installManifest, cmgr:scope
@harness   mk

# Intent
  Pin-tests for wiringPage's Page interface (bind / unbind / focusState).
  Render methods pull in ImGui and are exercised manually in REAPER.
  Persistence round-trips are pinned in wm_persistence_spec.
  
  wiringPage requires ImGui at module scope; stub via package.preload
  before the first require so the module loads in the pure-Lua harness.

# Helpers
  @fn newWiringPage(cm, ds, cmgr, chrome, gui, help)  @ 31-36

# Cases
  @case 'the manifest declares every command the wiring page registers'  [harness]  @ 43-60
  @case 'every group the wiring page places is one some scope declares'  [harness]  @ 66-81
  @case 'every bound command on the wiring page has a place on the cheat-sheet'  [harness]  @ 87-106
  @case 'bind / unbind are no-ops — wiring page never re-keys cm'  [harness]  @ 110-119
  @case 'focusState before any render returns both bits false'  [harness]  @ 123-130

# Uses (outbound edges)
  @use call cmgr:installManifest  @ 50
  @use call cmgr:scope  @ 52

